title: Kaito
---
<<declare $KaitoScore = 0>>
<<set $KaitoScore to random_range(500, 1000) >>
<<declare $PlayerScore = 0>>
<<declare $kaito_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $kaito_interaction_times == 0>>
  Kaito: Hey. You here to play one last game of Plasteroids?
  -> I'm just walking around.
    You: I'm just walking around.
    You: Seeing things before the end.
    Kaito: Seeing things? Right. What's the point? It's all going blank.
	  -> You don't care?
      You: You don't care?
      Kaito: I cared once. I used to care a lot.
      Kaito: Sometimes I forgot what I was even caring for.
      Kaito: Eventually, you run out of energy for that kind of stuff.
    -> Yeah...
      You: Yeah...
      You: But I think it's worth looking around for one last time.
  -> Heck yeah!
    Kaito: Oh dang! Try to beat me then.
  Kaito: Hang on, let me finish this game first.
  Kaito: Whoa! I got a {$KaitoScore}! Try and beat me!
  <<set $kaito_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $kaito_interaction_times == 1 and $KaitoScore > $PlayerScore>>
  Kaito: Ha, I guess I'm still the best at Plasteroids.
<<elseif $kaito_interaction_times == 1 and $KaitoScore < $PlayerScore>>
  Kaito: Wow, you really managed to beat me.
  Kaito: ...
  Kaito: Maybe I should take a break.
  -> Go touch some grass.
    You: Go touch some grass.
    Kaito: Ha! Sure.
    Kaito: Maybe I'll go to the park.
  -> I'm going to the park later.
    You: I'm going to the park later.
    You: Would you like to join me?
    Kaito: Hmm. That sounds nice. Maybe I'll join you there.
  You: See you there!
  <<TalkedToKaito KaitoTrigger>>
  <<set $kaito_interaction_times = 2>>
<<elseif $kaito_interaction_times == 2>>
  Kaito: See you at the park, man.

// so here there should be a trigger at the door of the arcade where he moves to the park or smth
// i'll add the rest of the next once that trigger is in place

<<endif>>

===
